* conf/web-shutdown.rc: MVS/CE SCRIPTS/SHUTDOWN.RC adapted for conf/web.cnf.
* _____ _____ _____ _____ ____  _____ _ _ _ _____ 
* |   __|  |  |  |  |_   _|    \|     | | | |   | |
* |__   |     |  |  | | | |  |  |  |  | | | | | | |
* |_____|__|__|_____| |_| |____/|_____|_____|_|___|
*
* setting up automated responses
hao clear
hao tgt HASP099
hao cmd script SCRIPTS/pjes2
hao tgt HASP085
hao cmd script SCRIPTS/zeod
hao tgt IEE334I
hao cmd script SCRIPTS/quiesce
* web variant (NUMCPU 1): there is no second CPU, so no "HHC00814I ... SIGP Stop" message.
* Power off when CP00 enters the normal end-of-QUIESCE disabled wait instead.
hao tgt HHC00809I Processor CP00: disabled wait state 000A0000 00000CCC
hao cmd script SCRIPTS/poweroff
hao tgt ([0-9]{2}) IKT010D 
hao cmd /R $1,FSTOP
# For information see https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/zos/2.3.0?topic=commands-mvs-system-reference
* Cancel the processing of all automatic commands.
/$CA,ALL 
pause 2
* Switching SMF
/SWITCH SMF
pause 2
* Preventing users from logging on
/MODIFY TSO,USERMAX=0
pause 2
* Stop JES2 Initiators
/$PI
pause 2
* Stopping JES2
/$P PRT1  
/$P PRT2  
/$P PRT3  
/$P PUNCH1
/$P RDR1
/$P RDR2  
pause 3
* Shutting down TSO
/STOP TSO
pause 3
* Shutting down VTAM
/HALT net,quick
pause 3